# Domain Catalog

Domain adapters customize evidence, authority, and fraud detection for specialized work.
Each domain adapter file in this catalog follows the schema in `.agents/skills/fable-domain/references/TEMPLATE.md`.

## Usage

```bash
/fable-domain create <domain-name>
```

## Adding a Domain

1. Pick a domain name (kebab-case, e.g. `infrastructure`, `data-science`, `marketing`)
2. Create `<domain>.md` in this directory
3. Follow the template structure: domain identity, authority sources, binding evidence, verification commands, domain frauds

## Example

See `.agents/skills/fable-domain/references/devops.md` for a complete reference adapter.
